DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260821
DTSTAMP:20260820T110130Z
UID:a9c778f04a9e6ab31cda4b6d4387@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The August 20 concert features Kelly &amp\; The Poor Boys\, pe
 rforming a Creedence Clearwater Revival tribute. All performances are weat
